  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td style="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; padding-bottom: 1.5pt"><span style="-keep: true">Share-based compensation(2)</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: right"><span style="-keep: true">1,565,212</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: right"><span style="-keep: true">2,649,573</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: right"><span style="-keep: true">(1,084,361</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">)</span></td></tr>
  </table><div>


</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px;"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0in"/><td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">(1)</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">Personnel-related costs consist primarily of salaries, bonuses,
employer payroll taxes, workers&#8217; compensation insurance and payroll administration costs. Personnel-related costs increased primarily
due to the expansion of the Company&#8217;s executive and operational workforce following the business combination, including the hiring
of executive personnel during the second half of 2024, resulting in a full year of compensation-related costs in 2025.</span></td>
</tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px;"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0in"/><td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">(2)</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">Share-based compensation expense decreased by approximately
$1.08 million, or 40.9%, to approximately $1.57 million for the year ended December 31, 2025, compared to approximately $2.65 million
for the year ended December 31, 2024. The decrease was primarily attributable to significant equity awards granted during 2024 in connection
with executive employment agreements, board and advisory appointments, and merger-related compensation arrangements that were immediately
vested and therefore did not recur at the same level during 2025. Share-based compensation expense during 2025 primarily related to the
continued vesting of previously granted awards and a lower volume of new equity grants.</span></td>
</tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">We expect general and administrative expenses
to increase in 2026 as compared to 2025 primarily due to an increase in operational activity, public company and corporate communications
expenses, and non-cash stock-based compensation.</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b style="-keep: true">Research and Development Expenses</b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">Research and development expenses increased
in fiscal year 2025 compared to fiscal year 2024 primarily due to increased spending on pre-clinical development activities, Sponsored
Research Agreements, and licensing arrangements in support of our gene therapy programs.</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">Research and development expenses increased
by approximately $634,000, or 100.0%, for the year ended December 31, 2025, compared to the year ended December 31, 2024. The increase
was primarily due to (i) an increase in expenses for KLTO-101 and KLTO-202 programs, primarily covering Sponsored Research with UAB and
Okinawa Research Center for Longevity Science R&amp;D and associated licensing payments of approximately $484,000 and (ii) an increase
in expenses of approximately $150,000 on its KLTO-202 program exclusively for its AAV vector work with AAVnergene.</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">The research and development expenses by program
are as follows:</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-spacing: 0px;">
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom">
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; font-weight: bold"><span style="-keep: true">Program</span></td><td style="font-weight: bold"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td>
    <td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; font-weight: bold; text-align: center"><span style="-keep: true">Year Ended<br/>
    December&#160;31, <br/>
    2025</span></td><td style="font-weight: bold"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td><td style="font-weight: bold"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td>
    <td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; font-weight: bold; text-align: center"><span style="-keep: true">Year Ended<br/>
    December&#160;31,<br/>
    2024</span></td><td style="font-weight: bold"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; width: 76%"><span style="-keep: true">KLTO-101 and KLTO-202</span></td><td style="width: 1%"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="width: 1%; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">$</span></td><td style="width: 9%; text-align: right"><span style="-keep: true">484,187</span></td><td style="width: 1%; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td><td style="width: 1%"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="width: 1%; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">$</span></td><td style="width: 9%; text-align: right"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;-</span></td><td style="width: 1%; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in"><span style="-keep: true">KLTO-202 Only</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: right"><span style="-keep: true">150,000</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: right"><span style="-keep: true">-</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in; font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1.5pt"><span style="-keep: true">Total</span></td><td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1.5pt"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; font-weight: bold; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; font-weight: bold; text-align: right"><span style="-keep: true">634,187</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td><td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1.5pt"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; font-weight: bold; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; font-weight: bold; text-align: right"><span style="-keep: true">-</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: left"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  </table><div>


</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">In 2024, we did not record R&amp;D expenses
but incurred expenses of $163,274 that ultimately supported the Company&#8217;s pre-clinical development activities, including IP legal
fees, the Scientific Advisory Board, and consultants.</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">These expenses reflect our investment in advancing
our research pipeline and preparing for future regulatory and development milestones. Research and development expenses may fluctuate
from period to period based on the timing of specific projects, licensing activities, milestone-based payments, and the scope of third-party
research services engaged.</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">We expect research and development expenses
to continue to represent a significant component of our operating expenses as we advance our product candidates. The timing and magnitude
of future research and development expenditures will depend on development progress, regulatory strategy, availability of capital, and
management&#8217;s prioritization of specific programs.</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p><div>

</div><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 54; Value: 1 --><div>
    </div><div style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid"><p style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->50<!-- Field: /Sequence --></p></div><div>
    </div><div style="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><p style="margin: 0pt">&#160;</p></div><div>
    </div><!-- Field: /Page --><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b style="-keep: true">Known Trends and Uncertainties</b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="-keep: true">Our historical operating expenses are not
necessarily indicative of future results due to the significant impact of non-recurring transaction-related costs, financing activities,
and compliance-driven expenditures incurred during fiscal year 2025. Known uncertainties that may materially affect future operating
results include our ability to raise additional capital, the timing and scope of research and development activities, changes in regulatory
requirements, and the extent of future strategic transactions.</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><i>Net Loss</i></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">For the year ended December 31, 2025, we incurred
a net loss of $10,551,674 compared to a net loss of $6,150,372 for the year ended December 31, 2024. The increase in net loss was primarily
due to increases in operating expenses of $1,606,029, interest expense of $1,957,358, settlement expense of $1,178,000, and change in
fair value of warrant liability of $26,553, partially offset by an increase in other income of $366,638.</p><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>Working Capital </b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-spacing: 0px;">
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom">
    <td>&#160;</td><td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td colspan="6" style="font-weight: bold; text-align: center; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid">As of December 31,</td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom">
    <td>&#160;</td><td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td colspan="2" style="font-weight: bold; text-align: center; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid">2025</td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td><td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td colspan="2" style="font-weight: bold; text-align: center; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid">2024</td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td></tr>
