    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">reviewing and discussing with management and the registered public accounting firm the results of the annual audit, the Company&#8217;s quarterly financial statements and the Company&#8217;s publicly filed reports;</span></td></tr>
  </table><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;">
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
