    <td style="text-align: justify">Under the terms the stock award agreement, on August 15, 2024, Jeffrey
LeBlanc received 400,000 share grants which vest under time restriction, whereby 50% vest after one year and the remaining 50% vest after
two years from the grant date. 133,334 shares remain unvested as of December 31, 2025, at an original grant market value of $69,375.</td></tr>
