    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Audit fees consist of fees for the audit of our 2025 and 2024 annual financial statements and the review of our 2025 and 2024 interim financial statements.</span></td></tr>
