<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>December 2023 ($135,000)</i></b>&#160;&#8211;
On December 1, 2023, the Company issued a promissory note to two members of management in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c129" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-15289">135,000</ix:nonFraction>. The promissory note
did not accrue interest. The promissory note was paid as of December 31, 2024.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

